    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Khorne Blood Surge.</strong> Khorne Blood Surge tears shape from the Winds of Magic and forces it into a weaponized moment: bright, cold, hungry, or cruel according to the lore that birthed it.</p><p><strong>Mechanics.</strong> Casting uses action at range 120 ft. Targets make INT save against the caster's spell save DC; on a failed save, apply 3d8 slashing damage.</p><blockquote><p>\"A spell is courage given a sharper name.\"<br><em>- Old World magister</em></p></blockquote>",
